        You will be given the root cause of a bug, the commit message and the corresponding patch.
        You need to extract all code statements that lead to the bug from the patch, based on the root cause and the commit message.

        Root cause:
        The root cause of the bug was the absence of necessary graph connections between the TCON TOP and the TCON components in the device tree structure for the R40. This lack of connections would prevent proper communication and functionality of the HDMI pipeline, leading to potential display issues or failures in rendering output.

